        <span itemprop="definition">contains the organic or inorganic particles, it has excellent permeability and high thermal stability at high temperature, and particularly, since it has excellent stability of the coating layer in high temperature organic electrolyte, it has a high meltdown temperature and a lower shrinkage at high temperature.</span>
